		"&6[Passive, In Slot]&r &5Fantasy Destruction&r –  "
		"Ignore &cALL&r restrictions and phenomena:  "
		"Bypass &dInfinity Prison&r, &dAbsolute Guard&r, and any weakening effects.  "
		""
		"&6[Passive, In Slot]&r &aOptimal Action&r –  "
		"Attacks &cignore all dodge&r.  "
		"Earn &a+10 learn/mastery points&r instead of 1.  "
		"&cNullifications are ignored&r entirely.  "
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trmysticism:textures/skill/ultimate/susanoo.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6[Active, Press {Toggle on Skill Mastery}]&r &cTrue Chaotic Fate&r –  "
		"Enhances &cpermanent health severance&r effect from earlier version.  "
		""
		"&6[Active, Press]&r &eCounter&r –  "
		"Enter &fGuard Stance&r for 3s.  "
		"If hit, activate &cCounter&r: enemy is silenced for 5s (&7Attack Speed = 0&r).  "
