	quest.12204DF3DC11596C.quest_desc: [
		"&aWelcome Adventurer!&r"
		""
		"&7Message: from the &4Creator&r"
		""
		"Hey! I'm really glad you're here. "
		""
		"My name is &4Wolosmedrah&r and i will be your guide!"
		""
		"HI IM ZEEFSKI UM I TOOK THIS GUYS HARD WORK AND TWEAKED IT A LITTLE ALL CREDIT TO HIM! "
		"i got permission first tho <3"
		""
		"Let's &astart&r with &ebasics."
		""
		"As &ayou&r can &esee&r at the &cend&r of this &bbox&r is &earrow&r, that &ameans&r this &cquest&r have &bmultiple&r pages."
		""
		"To &aprogress&r further &cclick&r on the &earrow&r."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Well done!&r"
		""
		"This &cmodpack&r was &acreated&r with &epurpose&r to &ahelp&r you get &binfo&r about &6tensura world&r, without &cneed&r to &elook&r for &binfo&r on &4wikipedia!"
		""
		""
		""
		"Please &eclick arrow&r and &awe&r will &bcontinue."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Let's go &atrough&r what this &cmodpack&r has in &4it!"
		""
		"&cWhen&r you &aopen&r your &6quest book&r or press \"&6J&r\" on your &ckeyboard."
		""
		"It &awill&r open &6quests&r in &cwhich&r on &bleft side&r is &6scrollable menu."
		""
		"&6Menu&r is &asorter&r by &csections&r and &4categories&r which &4i&r will &aintroduce&r you &cnow!"
		""
		"Please &eclick arrow&r and &awe&r will &bcontinue."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Thats &babout it&r i hope &cyou&r will &aenjoy&r the &6modpack&r :)"
		""
		"I &ewish&r you &agood&r luck &c<3"
		""
		"And if you &clike&r the &6modpack&r consider &asupporting&r it by &6donation&r which &ayou&r can &efind&r on &5discord"
		""
		"pay this man fr he chill!"
		""
		"Next is &amore&r info &eabout&r future of &6modpack&r"
		""
		"Please &eclick arrow&r and &awe&r will &bcontinue."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"This &amodpack&r is &cjust small&r part of &4larger project&r im &bworking on!"
		""
		"Name of the project is &6Chronicles of the Omniverse&r."
		""
		"This &6project&r will &2contain&r full &bprogress&r and &6in-game wiki&r for &aevery&r minecraft &cmod&r!"
		""
		"Mods will be &achoosen&r by &cpatreons&r and &4donators&r always &bone&r a &3month"
		""
		"You can &achoose&r which &cmods&r you &ewant&r to &aplay&r with and &cyou&r will get &6quest book&r based on &cthat."
		""
		"It &awill&r also provide &6base&r for &4developers&r and their &4modpack&r where &athey&r can &esimply&r add &crewards&r to &6quests&r as &athey&r see &bfit."
	]
