	quest.29CEC41393BE8BFB.quest_desc: [
		"{image:trmysticism:textures/skill/ultimate/antevorta.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6[Passive, Toggle]&r &dThought Acceleration&r – &7Amplifies mental speed, allowing enhanced reaction time.&r"
		""
		"&6[Passive, Toggle]&r &dUniversal Perception&r – &7Perceive everything around you in a radius, beyond the normal senses.&r"
		""
		"&6[Passive, In Slot]&r &dPrecognition&r – &a50% chance&r to dodge incoming attacks.  "
		"&7Increases to &a75%&r with Mastery."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trmysticism:textures/skill/ultimate/antevorta.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6[Passive, In Slot]&r &dDanger Detection&r – Sense potential threats.  "
		"&cEnemies 50% stronger&r than you are highlighted in &cRED&r.  "
		"On learning &bAntevorta&r, gain &dDanger Sense&r."
		""
		"&6[Passive, True]&r &dSeen It Before&r – Attacks against you build up a &aCounter&r per enemy type.  "
		"The higher it gets, the more you &9learn about them&r.  "
		"Future attacks may be completely &aNegated&r.  "
		"&7Cannot be overridden, even by Dodge Ignoring skills.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trmysticism:textures/skill/ultimate/antevorta.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6[Active, Press]&r &dAttack Vectors&r – Study your target, planning against their moves.  "
		"Next &a5 hits&r from them have &c-20% Damage&r.  "
		"&7Cooldown:&r &c1 minute&r (&a30s on Mastery&r)"
		""
		"&6[Active, Press]&r &dFuture Sight&r – Grants &bFuture Attack Prediction&r for &a30 seconds&r (&a40s with Mastery&r).  "
		"&7Cooldown:&r &c10 seconds&r"
		""
		"&6[Active, Press]&r &dRoll of the Dice&r – Roll a dice, result shows after 3 seconds.  "
		"&7Cooldown:&r &c3 minutes&r (&a2 minutes on Mastery&r).  "
		"&cYou receive no bonus for rolling your number.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trmysticism:textures/skill/ultimate/antevorta.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&7Dice Effects:&r  "
		""
		"- &cSnake Eyes&r – All entities in &a30 blocks&r are &cMarked for Death&r for &a30 seconds&r  "
		"- &eDouble Sixes&r – All first dice effects (except Levitation) are applied to foe. "
		" "
		"- &7Anything Else&r – Doubles effect of the number rolled "
		" "
		"- &7(Magic Jamming duration increases to 1 minute)&r"
	]
