		"- Turns &ctargets&r between &625%&r and &650%&r Neutral (&65%&r - &630%&r if &ctarget&r has &dSpiritual&r &bResist&r), and turns &ctargets&r below &625%&r (&65%&r if &ctarget&r has &dSpiritual&r &bResist&r) &6Max EP&r into &9temporary allies&r for &l6,000 Ticks&r."
