		"[In Neutral mode, the &9subordinate&r will defend when &cattacked&r or if the &7owner&r &cattacked&r or is &cattacked&r.]"
		"[In Passive mode, it will not target anything even if got &chit&r.]"
		"[In Aggressive mode, the &9subordinate&r will target &ceverything&r that is not an &9ally&r.] "
		"[In protect mode, it will target everything that is targeting its &7owner&r or &9ally&r.]"
