		""
		"&6[Active - Hold]&r &5Fallen Hypno&r – AoE &6Drowsiness&r:  "
		"- Radius: &a10x10&r (&a20x20 on Mastery&r)  "
		"- Applies level every &a7 seconds&r (&e8 with Resistance&r, &e10 with Nullification&r)"
		""
		"&6[Active - Hold]&r &5Deprive&r – Drain &b2000 MP/sec&r (&a+10% Target MP + 2000 on Mastery&r).  "
		"- &b500 MP&r per second is stored in &9Temp MP Storage&r.  "
		"- &7Crouch while not targeting&r to view stored MP."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trmysticism:textures/skill/ultimate/belphegor.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6[Active - Press]&r &5Fallen Catastrophe&r –  "
		"- If Target has &cSpiritual Nullification&r → &6Drowsiness 3&r  "
		"- If Target has &eSpiritual Resistance&r → &6Drowsiness 4&r  "
		"- If Neither → &cInstant Death&r  "
		"Cost: &b50,000 Stored MP&r  "
		"- &7If Crouching&r → Sleep for &a100 seconds&r (Cost: &b25,000&r Stored MP)"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trmysticism:textures/skill/ultimate/belphegor.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6[Active - Hold]&r &5Rest&r – While held:  "
		"- &cPlayer cannot move or act&r  "
		"- Heal &a40 HP + 1% Max HP (on Mastery)&r  "
		"- Regen &bMP/AP x40&r  "
		"- Excess goes into &9Temp MP Storage&r  "
		"- &7If crouching and no target&r → Show stored MP  "
		"- &7If crouching and enough stored MP&r → Heals &a2000 MP/AP, 100 HP, 20 SHP&r to allies in &a30x30&r"
		""
		"&6[Active - Press]&r &5Fallen Strike&r – &cRequires Mastery&r  "
		"- Deal &d15000 SHP&r  "
		"- Apply &6Drowsiness 3&r  "
		"- Ignores &cResistance&r and &cNullification&r  "
