		"{image:tensura:textures/skill/extra/sticky_steel_thread.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&6Active&r] &lSticky Steel Thread&r:"
		""
		"[&6Web-Slinger&r]:"
		""
		"- Sends out a &cweb projectile&r to the &7block&r the &7player&r is looking at. "
		"- If it lands, the web string will be attached to that &7landed block&r, the &7player&r can crouch to get pulled to the &7attached block&r, there will be &cno fall damage&r as long as they are below the Y level of the &7attached block&r. "
		"- The string will dissolve after &l1,200 Ticks&r, when the &blength&r exceeds &b50 Block&r, when the &7player&r reaches the &7attached block&r or when the &7player&r shift activates this &6mode&r again. "
		"- If the &cweb projectile&r hits an &centity&r instead, attach it to that &centity&r and this will work like a &7Lead&r but the &centity&r doesn’t take &dfall damage&r as long as its Y level is lower than the &7user’s&r, crouch to pull the &centity&r closer to the &7user&r, the string will snap if it exceeds &b30 Block length&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:tensura:textures/skill/extra/sticky_steel_thread.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&6Active&r] &lSticky Steel Thread&r:"
		""
		"[&6Arcane Thread Feathers&r]:"
		""
		"- Encases the looked at &cmob&r in &b10 Block radius&r in sticky-steel thread for &l500 Ticks&r. "
		"- Once activated again, during &l100 Ticks&r since encasing it, while looking at an &cencased mob&r, deal &c30 damage&r to the &cmob&r, remove &5Webbed&r."
		"- This &3Art&r is affected by &lAbilities&r that apply effects on attack like &6Corrosion&r, &6Poison&r, &6Shadow Striker&r, etc."
		""
		"[&l&6Mastery Bonus&r]:"
		""
		"- Increases &bradius&r to &b20 Block&r."
		"- Once activated again, during &l200 Ticks&r since encasing it, while looking at an &cencased mob&r, deal &c60 damage&r to the &cmob&r, remove &5Webbed&r."
		"- Decreases cooldown to &l60 Ticks&r."
	]
