	quest.58483C9FB036B493.quest_desc: [
		"&1HI ZEEFSKI HERE!"
		""
		""
		"If you are familiar with the older version, then this one is a little different. Instead of all info being shown here there is a mod with a book that does the job of the wiki. &5sadly this currently only includes unique skills for now &r so i recommend looking at the online wiki if you need help: https://tensura.wiki.gg/ and for the main addon: https://trmysticism.wiki.gg/"
		""
		"However there is &2ANOTHER skill description mod&r that is very useful but only for skills that you have, no battlewills or magic. In the Status menu on the right hand side click the third tab to go to ability archive. or can be accessed by clicking on any skill description."
		"{image:foxablazeaqzl_wiki:textures/gui/wiki_tab_icon.png width:30 height:30 align:center}"
		""
		"This time Ive not disabled anything non canon so go crazy to your hearts content. There is a lot of wild extra shit in here so yeah lol expect the unexpected!"
		""
		"here is the book, you can repeat if u lose it so dont worry"
	]
