	quest.5CD1CEE26E1E5D09.quest_desc: [
		"{image:trmysticism:textures/skill/ultimate/sariel.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6[Passive, True]&r &eUnyielding&r –  "
		"Grant &aInspiration&r and &aAlly Boost&r to all allies within &f15 blocks&r.  "
		"Allies gain &b+3 Unyielding Points&r every 10 seconds.  "
		"At &bMastery&r: &aInspiration II&r, &aAlly Boost II&r, and &b+4 Points&r per 10s.  "
		"Cap increased to &d1800&r. Unlock &6Ally Ultimate Skills&r at 1800 points.  "
		"(&7Points between 1201 - 1799 have no effect.&r)"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trmysticism:textures/skill/ultimate/sariel.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6[Passive, In Slot]&r –  "
		"Gain a buff to &cPhysical&r and &eBattlewill&r damage.  "
		"All attacks &bBypass Physical Resistance&r (&3Null = Treated as Resist&r)  "
		"Allows damage to &dSpiritual Lifeforms&r."
		""
		"&6[Passive, Toggle]&r &bThought Acceleration&r –  "
		"Increase &9Casting Speed, Attack Speed and Movement Speed&r.  "
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trmysticism:textures/skill/ultimate/sariel.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
