	quest.682F079DC31B572C.quest_desc: [
		"{image:tensura:textures/battlewill/death_march_dance.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&cHold&r] &lDeath March Dance&r:"
		""
		"- While held down, charges a meter that increases the size of a Magic Bullet above the player's head. "
		"- The magic bullet increases in size every 40 ticks, with a maximum size level of 5. "
		"- When the hold is released, sends regular sized Magic Bullets in all directions around the user, with the amount depending on the size level. "
		"- Each magic bullet deals &c25 damage&r."
