		"[&6Active&r] &lBody Double&r:"
		""
		"[&6Clone Creation&r]:"
		""
		"- Costs &910%&r of the &7user's&r &9Max MP&r and creates a &9Body Double entity&r with identical &lStats&r to the &9player&r and &acopy&r set of &7gears&r, but with a &5permanent Fragility II&r and &apassively regenerate 2 HP&r every &l20 Ticks&r. "
		"- The &9entity&r acts as a &afriendly mob&r to the &7player&r similar to a &adog&r and will &cattack enemies&r. "
		"- Lasts until deactivated, it &9runs out of energy&r or is &ckilled&r. "
		"- Remaining &9energy&r is returned to the &7player&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:tensura:textures/skill/extra/body_double.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&6Active&r] &lBody Double&r:"
		""
		"[&6Clone Control&r]:"
		""
		"- Shift activate while looking at a &9clone&r to remove it. "
		"- If activated while looking at a &9created clone&r in &b50 Block radius&r, switch &7body&r with that &9clone&r, leaving the &7original body&r behind, when this &7original body&r is &ckilled&r, the &7user&r &cdies&r. "
		"- While controlling a &9clone&r, the &7user&r will not generate &9MP&r and going without the &7original body&r in &b50 Block radius&r, the &7user&r takes &710&d%&r of both &7physical&r and &dspiritual damage&r. "
		"- If &7user&r &cdies&r while being in a &9clone&r, the &7user&r &cdoesn’t die&r and gets moved back to the &7original body&r."
	]
